		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Skeleton full of swollen, purple entrails and organs, birthed from the bodies of mass murderers.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +3 (1d8) and 1 tongue +3 (1 + paralyze) and spawn zombie, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Paralyze</strong>. CON 12+ or paralyzed 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Spawn Zombie</strong>. When the mohrg kills a sentient creature, the victim rises as a zombie in 1 round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
